.TH ifg-draft 1  "ifg-draft 0.9.0"
.SH NAME
ifg\-draft \- Reserve and manage agent draft branch namespaces
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBifg draft\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Reserve and manage agent draft branch namespaces
.PP
A namespace reserves a branch directory such as `agent/<id>/`. Pushes under it trigger CI but send no webhooks or mail, and the server deletes the branches after the namespace expires and its grace period ends. Durations take `s`, `m`, `h` or `d` (`90m`, `7d`); a bare number is seconds.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
ifg\-draft\-list(1)
List the repository\*(Aqs draft namespaces
.TP
ifg\-draft\-create(1)
Reserve a branch directory for a limited time
.TP
ifg\-draft\-extend(1)
Push the deadline back
.TP
ifg\-draft\-close(1)
Close a namespace now; its branches are deleted after the grace period
.TP
ifg\-draft\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
.SH VERSION
v0.9.0
